/T (Indian equity markets ended CY 2025 near all-time highs, reflecting resilience amid a challenging global environment. The Nifty and Sensex closed the year above the key psychological levels of 26,000 and 85,000, respectively. Performance, however, was uneven across market segments. Large-cap stocks outperformed, while midcaps and small caps struggled. The Nifty Small cap 250 Index ended the year in the red, making 2025 a particularly difficult year for small-cap investors.)
/E (Indian equity markets ended CY 2025 near all-time highs, reflecting resilience amid a challenging global environment. The Nifty and Sensex closed the year above the key psychological levels of 26,000 and 85,000, respectively. Performance, however, was uneven across market segments. Large-cap stocks outperformed, while midcaps and small caps struggled. The Nifty Small cap 250 Index ended the year in the red, making 2025 a particularly difficult year for small-cap investors.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
