/T (In the commodities space, precious metals delivered an exceptional performance. Gold rose 75% in CY 2025, while silver recorded an extraordinary 168% year-on-year gain, making it one of the best-performing asset classes globally. Precious metals are expected to remain supported in 2026 due to central bank buying, falling US interest rates, geopolitical uncertainty, and shifting global dynamics. Meanwhile, crude oil prices softened and slipped below the $60 per barrel mark, reflecting easing demand and global growth concerns.)
